---
import BaseLayout from '~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SystemMap from '~/components/SystemMap.astro';
import SignerFamilyGrid from '~/components/SignerFamilyGrid.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="System — nSealr" description="Product shape: one companion and five signer families for Nostr signing.">
  <section class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">// system</p>
    <h1>One companion. Five signer solutions.</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      The practical product is a shared companion plus five signer solutions,
      not five unrelated experiments. Every shared feature behaves the same
      across implementations because the <code>contract_id</code> in
      <code>nSealr/specs</code> defines it once.
    </p>
    <SystemMap />
    <h2>Solutions</h2>
    <SignerFamilyGrid />
    <h2>Companion surfaces</h2>
    <p class="muted">
      The companion is a single TypeScript monorepo that ships multiple
      access surfaces over the same secretless platform. Every surface
      reuses the same validation, transport, and response-verification
      logic.
    </p>
    <ul class="surfaces-list">
      <li><strong><code>nsealr</code> CLI</strong> — request construction, transports, verification, audit export.</li>
      <li><strong>npm SDK</strong> — embed the companion in any Nostr client or service.</li>
      <li><strong>browser extension</strong> — NIP-07 surface backed by a signer.</li>
      <li><strong>local app</strong> — desktop UI for routing and review.</li>
      <li><strong>local service</strong> — background daemon for the extension and apps.</li>
      <li><strong>NIP-46 bridge</strong> — converts already-decrypted NIP-46 payloads into standard nSealr signing requests.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Boundaries</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Companion:</strong> secretless routing and verification infrastructure. Not trusted with keys.</li>
      <li><strong>QR vaults:</strong> stateless RAM-only session signers.</li>
      <li><strong>USB/NIP-46:</strong> future persistent encrypted device-vault signer.</li>
      <li><strong>Smartcards:</strong> display-less slot-backed custody — requires external review acknowledgement.</li>
      <li><strong>Custom wallet:</strong> research for persistent-secret hardware wallets.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .container { padding-block: 60px; }
  h1 { font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--fg-strong); font-size: clamp(32px, 4.5vw, 56px); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 8px 0 18px; }
  h2 { font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--fg-strong); font-size: 22px; margin: 36px 0 14px; }
  .lead, .muted { color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: clamp(15px, 1.6vw, 18px); max-width: 64ch; }
  ul { display: grid; gap: 8px; max-width: 80ch; }
  .surfaces-list strong code { background: var(--accent-bg); color: var(--accent-soft); padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); border: 0; }
</style>
